Extract EXIF / PDF / OLE metadata for a single file.

Runs server-mode (POST /api/v1/metadata/jobs) when --server or
$USULNET_API_URL is set; otherwise local mode runs the
recon-toolkit container against the host Docker daemon.

Use --output json|yaml for scripts; the default table format only
includes the exiftool sub-map.

Usage:
  usulnet meta extract <path> [flags]

Examples:
  usulnet meta extract photo.jpg
  usulnet meta extract photo.jpg --output json
  usulnet meta extract doc.pdf --server https://usulnet.local --token $USULNET_API_TOKEN

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for extract

Global Flags:
  -c, --config string    config file path (default: /etc/usulnet/config.yaml or ./config.yaml)
      --image string     toolkit image (local mode only; default $USULNET_RECON_TOOLKIT_IMAGE)
      --json             shortcut for --output json (overrides --output)
      --output string    output format: table|json|yaml (default "table")
  -q, --quiet            suppress informational output (errors and primary data still print)
      --server string    usulnet API URL (forces server mode; default $USULNET_API_URL)
      --timeout string   container timeout (e.g. 30s)
      --token string     API token (default $USULNET_API_TOKEN)
